VIEWMODEL.md C40, §4.5 (log-2026-09-28 check follow-ups 2): a `control:` given a string or an expression instead of a name is E1609, whatever the text names; a name in parentheses is a name.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local record Item {
  count: Int
  label: String
  on: Bool
}

view Item {
  count { control: "slider" }
  label { control: 3 }
  on { control: (switch) }
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E1609]  a/a.canon:10:20
  "slider" is not a built-in control (VIEWMODEL.md §4.5 lists them)

error[E1609]  a/a.canon:11:20
  3 is not a built-in control (VIEWMODEL.md §4.5 lists them)

2 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
